Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.03,0:00:08.78,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I-
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:11.25,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I love you, Okazaki-kun! {this ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.54,0:00:13.37,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Please date me! {this ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.21,0:00:17.38,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.38,0:00:23.01,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. You wouldn't know what to do\Neven if I say something like this, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:26.72,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,But it hurts not to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.47,0:00:30.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ah... You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.31,0:00:31.18,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.31,0:00:39.31,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks. But we only recently started to get to know one another, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.31,0:00:42.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Like, we eat lunch with three of us,\NKyou included, often, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.70,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.70,0:00:50.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm saying I don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.78,0:00:54.71,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,More like, I wasn't really looking to get in a relationship with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.71,0:00:58.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Wait, I guess that was rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:03.13,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If that's fine with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.13,0:01:04.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,do you want to give dating a try?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.63,0:01:11.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We're both going to get to know each other a bit at a time, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:19.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then, I thought it's not so bad to spend that time as boyfriend and girlfriend, not just as friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.11,0:01:21.36,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.23,0:01:25.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're my girlfriend starting now. Sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.99,0:01:30.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.16,0:01:35.08,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm sorry... I can't stop my tears...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.21,0:01:38.58,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's as if I'm dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.54,0:01:40.67,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'm so happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:43.67,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.07,0:02:08.66,OP Romaji,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}{\kf24}ki{\kf23}mi {\kf20}da{\kf22}ke {\kf33}ga {\kf32}su{\kf19}gi{\kf27}sa{\kf19}t{\kf39}ta {\kf48}sa{\kf43}ka {\kf42}no {\kf39}to{\kf24}chu{\kf29}u {\kf75}wa
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.07,0:02:08.66,OP English,,0,0,0,,{\be1\fad(250,0)}The hill you once walked down...
