Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.14,0:03:19.81,Signs,,0,0,0,,{\fad(400,0)\fs60\blur2\bord2\3c&H4A8A5C&\pos(960,720)}Kyou Chapter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.23,0:03:22.98,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh. You're trying to go to nursing school?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.98,0:03:26.69,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Yes, it's been my dream since I was little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.69,0:03:30.53,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I haven't thought about my future at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.53,0:03:32.95,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Um, I don't think you need to rush.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.95,0:03:34.03,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.66,0:03:38.37,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If I sit around doing nothing,\Neven you might get fed up with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.37,0:03:40.16,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,That's impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.58,0:03:44.83,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I won't get fed up with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.59,0:03:47.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:53.59,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Nobody's ever said anything like that to me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.59,0:03:55.55,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,So I'm a little touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.60,0:03:58.51,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's nothing...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.98,0:04:10.32,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.95,0:04:19.66,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What are you doing on a Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.66,0:04:22.12,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You have to spend time with Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.12,0:04:24.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Mind your own business, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.87,0:04:28.04,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah, I guess. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.54,0:04:30.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:34.63,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.72,0:04:39.35,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,She's liked you since she was a junior.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.72,0:04:41.35,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:43.98,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So? You think you two will get along fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:45.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.69,0:04:50.65,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,She's diligent and kind, but blushes really easily, so I have to make sure I take it easy with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.65,0:04:51.86,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah, exactly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.86,0:04:55.20,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,But that's also what's cute about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.32,0:04:56.86,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.11,0:05:00.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I was just thinking you really watch out for your sister. {this ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.62,0:05:06.12,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Not really. {this ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.67,0:05:08.75,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.34,0:05:11.34,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.46,0:05:14.05,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Have you kissed Ryou yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.05,0:05:14.84,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.84,0:05:17.26,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,O-Of course I haven't!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.84,0:05:21.26,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Come on! You have to lead her more.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.26,0:05:26.48,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Even if you say that, this is my first time dating a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.85,0:05:30.56,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Then do you want to practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:32.73,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Practice kissing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:33.57,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,With me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.32,0:05:38.66,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Think of me as Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.66,0:05:41.37,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,We are twins, so we look alike, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.91,0:05:43.62,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:58.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.26,0:06:02.72,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's practice, so we can't really do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.72,0:06:04.01,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.31,0:06:06.85,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,By any chance, were you taking it seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.73,0:06:10.27,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course not, you idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.90,0:06:13.36,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'd say that was a six out of ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.36,0:06:14.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.19,0:06:16.36,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.36,0:06:17.15,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.41,0:06:30.92,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,In that park.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.92,0:06:33.29,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Seriously? Okazaki as in that delinquent?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.29,0:06:34.75,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Ah, those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.75,0:06:37.17,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,They used to be in the same class. And they still look pretty close.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.17,0:06:37.92,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,But-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:38.80,Default,Guys,0,0,0,,Wow, he's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.80,0:06:40.05,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Keep it down, stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.09,0:06:44.05,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Why do it at a place like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.05,0:06:45.93,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Isn't he embarrassed?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.93,0:06:47.31,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.31,0:06:49.68,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What are they all talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.06,0:06:51.77,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,'Morning, Okazaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.56,0:06:54.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What, even you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.82,Signs,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fnEdo SZ\fs90\c&H1F2521&\pos(948,189)}Do not run
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.82,Signs,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fnEdo SZ\fs63\pos(844.5,669)\c&H2F3838&}in the hallway
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:56.82,Signs,Oka,0,0,0,,{\fnEdo SZ\fs45\c&HBDBCC3&\pos(814.5,723)}danger
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.02,0:06:57.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What?! Me and Kyou?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:06:59.53,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Everyone at school knows about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:01.86,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,That you were kissing Kyou yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.86,0:07:05.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Oh. How should I explain that...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.70,0:07:07.20,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's not what everyone thinks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.95,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.95,0:07:11.83,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I knew something was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.83,0:07:13.96,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You looked like you were having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.96,0:07:15.88,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm saying nothing happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:19.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Besides, I'm dating the younger sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.38,0:07:22.43,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You and Fujibayashi Ryou?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.43,0:07:23.59,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Is it that big of a surprise?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:28.27,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Well, you guys are complete opposites of each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.27,0:07:30.56,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,On the other hand, I can imagine you dating Kyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.56,0:07:32.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Don't come up with things on your own!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.02,0:07:36.19,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, does Fujibayashi know about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.19,0:07:39.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I bet she'll hear it when she comes to school whether she likes it or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.15,0:07:41.53,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ah, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.82,0:07:44.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.70,0:07:45.99,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Come with me for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:48.37,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I won't take up too much of your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.12,0:07:49.20,Default-alt,Sun,0,0,0,,I haven't done anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.37,0:07:49.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey, Kyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.74,0:07:50.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You-
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.30,0:08:07.89,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You know, I seriously can't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.89,0:08:11.89,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Why not? Is what I'm saying that strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.89,0:08:15.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,More like, I never sensed anything like that between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.52,0:08:20.48,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Is it one of those things you don't notice because you were too close?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:23.28,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yeah, maybe it's something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.99,0:08:29.08,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey, you want me to show you very simple proof?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.29,0:08:34.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,W-Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:45.13,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,This is strange. Are you sure you like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:46.59,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.10,0:08:52.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if I'm wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.02,0:08:55.73,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,but you like Okazaki, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.31,0:08:59.56,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,W-What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.56,0:09:01.94,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I... I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.70,0:09:17.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,She tried to go out with me to\Nget rid of that rumor of you and her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.08,0:09:19.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Who cares about rumors?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.38,0:09:22.84,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If it were just an ordinary rumor, I don't think she'd go this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:30.30,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.14,0:09:37.98,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey, don't take what Youhei said seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.69,0:09:44.78,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Seeing you and Ryou so close,\NI felt like wanting a boyfriend, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.78,0:09:48.11,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So I thought I'd pick Youhei.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:48.95,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Then-
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.70,0:09:49.61,Default-alt,Oka,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.87,0:09:55.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Do you go fishing for guys on a whim like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.29,0:09:59.46,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.42,0:10:10.84,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You should only think about Ryou. {this ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.26,0:10:12.30,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.72,0:10:16.77,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You can't make your girlfriend worry about you. {this ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:17.77,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,See ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.32,0:10:28.53,Default,Staff,0,0,0,,That'll be ¥800.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.83,0:10:35.79,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.20,0:10:41.00,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I wanted to try calling you by your first name.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.71,0:10:43.79,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,You didn't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.50,0:10:46.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.09,0:10:47.30,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.30,0:10:49.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah. Kyou always calls me by-
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.64,0:10:55.60,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,You're right. You're thinking, "why now".
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:57.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.64,0:11:01.81,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,If you don't mind, could you call me "Ryou", as well?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.40,0:11:03.36,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:05.07,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Then, Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.27,0:11:06.98,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,T-Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.57,0:11:14.03,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'll see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.03,0:11:14.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.33,0:11:19.41,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.37,0:11:24.00,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:30.67,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I guess I'll stop by Sunohara's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.30,0:11:33.39,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Botan!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:34.51,Default,Bot,0,0,0,,Puhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.72,0:11:38.97,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong? It's Sunday today, so nobody's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:40.02,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.98,0:11:45.44,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Botan! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.28,0:11:54.28,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.66,0:11:58.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.45,0:12:01.58,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,N-Nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:04.08,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,What about you? Weren't you on a date with Ryou?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.08,0:12:07.46,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You're soaking wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.09,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Don't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.60,0:12:18.60,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Don't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.14,0:12:20.39,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.93,0:12:25.15,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Y-you should only think about Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.02,0:12:27.94,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Since, after all, you're Ryou's boyfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:31.99,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,That's got nothing to do with this right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.99,0:12:32.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,You'll catch cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.61,0:12:33.90,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I said don't come!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.40,0:12:36.70,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You have to leave me alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.99,0:12:40.16,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Don't bother with me anymore...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.16,0:12:40.95,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.95,0:12:42.12,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:46.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.92,0:12:48.71,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,S... Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.14,0:13:01.93,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Stop being kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.68,0:13:05.44,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm an idiot...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.73,0:13:09.48,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,...so if you act kind to me, I'll get the wrong idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.78,0:13:15.32,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I was afraid. {this ep}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.99,0:13:18.41,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I was afraid to ask you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:27.04,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,If I had asked you out and gotten rejected,\Nwe might not even have been able to stay friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.83,0:13:33.17,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Even if I'd gotten to go out with you, Ryou would have become sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.46,0:13:37.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Then, it was best that I gave up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.22,0:13:41.26,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I thought that would be the best for everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.81,0:13:46.48,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yet... now, I'm feel nothing but regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.73,0:13:50.90,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm such an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.52,0:13:53.82,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's something I chose, and yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.57,0:13:57.49,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kyou, I'm-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.49,0:13:58.45,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.53,0:14:02.24,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm Fujibayashi Kyou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:04.87,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I'm not Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.92,0:14:11.25,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I was too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.46,0:14:15.59,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Bye bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.94,0:14:35.90,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it's a complicated matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:37.19,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,All of this with twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.61,0:14:39.40,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,What would you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.40,0:14:41.82,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If I were in your shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.32,0:14:46.16,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Make them both mine. No questions asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.16,0:14:48.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Can I punch you until you stop moving?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.54,0:14:50.33,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I was joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.79,0:14:55.46,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,Honestly, it's a big hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,If this is what I have to face...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.38,0:15:00.34,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.13,0:15:03.60,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If you want to keep your distance from both of them now,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.60,0:15:05.39,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,then that's the loser's way out.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.39,0:15:13.81,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're trying to stay unscarred, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.73,0:15:20.40,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,If you've come this far, you'll have to hurt someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.11,0:15:25.37,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,The more time you take to decide, the deeper and more it'll hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.62,0:15:29.20,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,For all three of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.08,0:15:31.16,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.54,0:15:36.59,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,By the way, can I say one more thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.63,0:15:42.51,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,People'd kill to have your problem!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.47,0:15:46.10,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.68,0:15:50.35,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,All right, time for lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.74,0:16:06.78,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.66,0:16:10.62,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,What did you need to talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.58,0:16:15.08,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,It's just the two of us, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.79,0:16:23.72,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,{\fs78.3}In manga, when it comes to being alone in a classroom after school, we usually see a kiss scene, don't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.72,0:16:24.09,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Fujibayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.64,0:16:28.68,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Why are you calling me by my last name?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.68,0:16:35.77,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I always wanted to beat Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.94,0:16:39.11,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I didn't want to lose to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.15,0:16:46.74,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I knew who Onee-chan always had her eye on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.41,0:16:52.04,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I asked for her advice, knowing her feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.54,0:16:56.62,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I told her I wanted to get close with Tomoya-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.63,0:17:02.09,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,She was surprised, but smiled right after.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:05.01,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,She said, "Leave it to me."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.68,0:17:09.35,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I knew she'd say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.60,0:17:13.39,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I knew I was being dirty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.60,0:17:19.73,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Even then... Even then, I wanted to be near you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.57,0:17:24.11,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Can't I replace Onee-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.86,0:17:28.87,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'll become more outgoing like Onee-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.53,0:17:32.37,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I'll grow out my hair and practice cooking, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.08,0:17:36.29,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I will become the girl you wish for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.29,0:17:37.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:39.83,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.63,0:17:43.05,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I don't want you to do something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.09,0:17:48.34,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I want to be close to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.84,0:17:50.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.37,0:18:14.08,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Okay, next problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.37,0:18:15.54,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Fujibayashi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.79,0:18:18.16,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,I guess she's not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.16,0:18:19.42,Default,Teacher,0,0,0,,Then Suzuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.76,0:18:33.01,Default,Sun,0,0,0,,You're not going home?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.07,0:18:54.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The days I spent with you were a lot of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.12,0:19:01.33,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I realized for the first time that it makes me so happy to be needed by others.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.63,0:19:08.51,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I thought I'd get along well with you like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.01,0:19:13.30,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.26,0:19:18.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was being a jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:22.56,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,While I was with you, I was looking at someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:26.57,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I kept it to myself even after realizing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.28,0:19:30.90,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I was taking advantage of your kindness...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.95,0:19:32.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.24,0:19:36.74,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,The person I love is...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.58,0:19:39.70,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,...is your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.16,0:19:42.12,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.92,0:19:44.83,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.46,0:19:50.38,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Kyou!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.51,0:19:52.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Why did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.34,0:19:54.93,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Your hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.60,0:19:57.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,She yelled at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.77,0:20:03.39,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ryou told me not to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.19,0:20:07.15,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I didn't mind if it stayed this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.61,0:20:16.74,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K20}The {\K147}place {\K69}chan{\K51}ges {\K34}and {\K176}goes.{\K35} {\K39}Like {\K41}a {\K158}wind,{\K35} {\K79}like {\K184}clouds,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:13.95,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I didn't want to choose you if it meant hurting Ryou.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.11,0:20:17.37,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,But she said it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.53,0:20:30.42,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K36}Like {\K30}the {\K136}tra{\K91}ces {\K30}of {\K36}the {\K136}heart,{\K80} {\K67}no {\K93}halt{\K46} {\K62}at {\K37}the {\K458}places.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.37,0:20:19.33,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,"That's impossible."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.29,0:20:21.70,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,"It's too late."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:27.21,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,"If you really love Tomoya, you can't run away anymore."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.04,0:20:31.76,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,"There's no other choice but for both of us to get hurt."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.05,0:20:41.60,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K20}The {\K160}place {\K54}is {\K84}so {\K150}far {\K66}a{\K97}way{\K43} {\K52}be {\K85}far {\K77}a{\K115}part.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.42,0:20:35.89,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,"We ended up loving the same person."
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.64,0:20:40.39,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I bet she's crying right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.64,0:20:54.86,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K112}People's {\K88}hand{\K47} {\K74}does {\K75}not {\K140}reach,{\K47} {\K75}so {\K83}mere{\K66}ly {\K65}has {\K38}the {\K33}wor{\K328}ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.14,0:20:48.31,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Really, we're so late.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.56,0:20:52.90,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Realizing, acting as though not realizing, and facing each other, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.07,0:20:59.45,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,But I'll make this the last time we get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.45,0:21:07.29,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K34}The {\K147}place {\K71}is {\K59}a {\K146}lofty {\K57}lord, {\K90}can't {\K58}meet{\K19} {\K56}no{\K54}bo{\K43}dy {\K51}put {\K149}on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:05.50,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Her, me, and you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.46,0:21:20.35,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K61}We {\K154}will {\K71}lose {\K73}the {\K123}place, {\K73}so {\K210}lofty {\K77}which {\K399}changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.50,0:21:08.17,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.80,0:21:13.97,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I love you, Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:17.64,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I've... I've...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.10,0:21:20.39,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,...always loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.72,0:21:32.23,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K86}Not {\K77}all {\K136}were {\K39}de{\K197}sired.{\K48} {\K47}How{\K91}ever, {\K137}we're {\K93}never {\K152}sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.86,0:21:33.44,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Please don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.65,0:21:46.66,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K89}Still, {\K117}there {\K33}is {\K101}still {\K33}the {\K161}place.{\K52} {\K32}Far {\K35}a{\K87}way.{\K49} {\K57}Far {\K53}a{\K450}way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.03,0:21:34.82,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.15,0:21:42.70,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,If you apologize and I accept your apology, it'll feel like all of this was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:48.50,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I want to make those times a memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:50.79,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,All the fun times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.21,0:21:52.75,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,All the hard times.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.38,0:21:54.26,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,All of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.05,0:21:58.72,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,So please, don't apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.97,0:22:00.76,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.76,0:22:02.72,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:11.77,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Where were we going tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.77,0:22:13.86,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,We said we'd go somewhere, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.86,0:22:16.44,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ah, sorry. Cancel that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.57,0:22:26.54,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K37}The {\K99}place {\K37}bu{\K54}ried {\K47}in {\K36}deep {\K186}snow.{\K43} {\K28}Like {\K34}the {\K140}co{\K42}llap{\K63}sing {\K29}ca{\K176}stle.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.82,0:22:21.49,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Ryou came and said let's go shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:22.53,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,So no can go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.37,0:22:26.04,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,I guess I don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.37,0:22:39.80,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K52}Like {\K27}the {\K208}head {\K45}of {\K22}the {\K169}shade,{\K53} {\K38}fi{\K38}gure {\K106}will {\K25}be {\K79}thrown {\K34}a{\K397}way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.75,0:22:28.75,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yup. There's nothing you can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.34,0:22:35.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,It's really been hot these days, hasn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.38,0:22:36.34,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.76,0:22:40.80,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Hey. Was I really the right choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.18,0:22:51.81,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K33}The {\K94}place {\K98}is {\K58}a {\K70}lof{\K71}ty {\K70}lord, {\K82}can't {\K39}meet {\K88}no{\K70}bo{\K44}dy {\K42}put {\K155}on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.64,0:22:42.47,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:47.85,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Are you sure you're not thinking it was more comfortable being with Ryou?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.43,0:22:50.69,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Hey. I'll get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.69,0:22:52.40,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Yes. Please get mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.85,0:23:07.66,Kara-Ins,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,300)\be1\pos(960,48)}{\K20}{\K81}Still, {\K107}there {\K33}is {\K80}still {\K58}the {\K114}place.{\K29} {\K80}Far {\K66}a{\K136}way. {\K79}Far {\K64}a{\K601}way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.11,0:22:55.69,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Then I'll rest easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.36,0:22:58.61,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Isn't something wrong there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.15,0:23:01.74,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Then let's make it simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.24,0:23:07.91,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.43,0:23:22.95,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Tomoya.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.95,0:23:24.50,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.31,0:23:31.01,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Summer's coming, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.57,0:23:32.52,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,Yeah.
