Comment: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:08.65,0:00:11.24,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,I love you, Okazaki-kun!
Comment: 0,0:00:11.53,0:00:13.36,Default,Ryo,0,0,0,,Please date me!
Comment: 0,0:00:14.07,0:00:17.28,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You should only think about Ryou.
Comment: 0,0:00:17.57,0:00:20.58,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,You can't make your girlfriend worry about you.
Comment: 0,0:00:21.75,0:00:25.54,Default,Oka,0,0,0,,No, I was just thinking you really watch out for your sister.
Comment: 0,0:00:29.42,0:00:30.75,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,Not really.
Comment: 0,0:00:33.13,0:00:34.38,Default,Kyo,0,0,0,,I was afraid.
